  "sourceTitle": "Beer Battered Onion Rings",
  "sourceText": "Beer Battered Onion Rings\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 11, 2009 - 12:10am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup plain flour\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n2 tablespoons salad oil\n1 egg, beaten\n1 lg. Bermuda onions, cut into rings\n2/3 cup beer\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Make a batter of flour, salt, beer, oil and egg. Mix well. Dip onion rings into batter and fry in hot oil until brown. Drain on paper towels and serve hot.",
